## Capsule Wardrobe Formula

### The 12-Piece System
| Category | Pieces | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Dark wash jeans | 1 | Pairs with everything |
| Cargo jeans | 1 | Different colour from jeans |
| Trouser | 1 | Navy or charcoal |
| Plain tees | 3 | White, black, grey |
| Printed tees | 2 | Minimal graphic or abstract |
| Casual shirts | 2 | Beige and navy |
| Statement bottom | 1 | Cargo or unique denim |
| **Total** | **12** | **30+ outfit combinations** |

### Buying Decision Rule
Before buying any new arrival ask:
- Does it pair with 3+ existing pieces? → Buy
- Does it fill a category gap? → Buy
- Does it replace a degraded piece? → Buy
- None of the above? → Skip

